harmony when you land on an alien planet  take a look at the toothy chittering  horrors that maybe want to eat you and  say damn those guys are cool  so you pursue the Harmony affinity you  get some bug buddies learn to breathe  miasma and generally make all your stuff  look greenish and lumpy so what does it  take to win and what kind of alien  megafauna can you wield against your  enemies the Harmony victory is pretty  research heavy requiring three separate  texts before you really get going  transgenics swarm intelligence and nano  robotics are kind of all over the place  on the tech web so it behooves you to  boost your science output by not only  making some science eQuest decisions but  also by sending your covert agents to  robble robble a bunch of little blue  flasks from your fellow colonizers and  during the mid game you're going to want  to lock down a bunch of Zeno mass  resources for later on or just line up a  bunch of favors with your trading  partners and call in the Zeno mass once  the time comes to build elite units once  you've got those three texts under your  belt it's time to build the mind flower  this wonder takes up a tile on your  territory and can be destroyed by bad  guys so pick one that's fairly  defensible I wasn't at war with anyone  yet but I still laid down a barrier of  miasma across the borders of my capital  and threw up a combat boosting TAC net  satellite just in case while the mind  flower is being constructed by your  capital have your other cities build  mind stem and Zeno sanctuary buildings  these will hasten the awakening of the  planet once the mind stem is complete  meanwhile send your research tendrils  out to designer life-forms and alien  evolution so you can build some badass  military units in case anyone gets  nervous about your efforts to transcend  humanity the rocktopus is a giant  floating man of war that can fly up into  the orbital lair and support the ground  units below in a bunch of ways and also  sling 